Comment: 1,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an4\fnSFProText-Light-STR\c&H0000FF&\fscx52.2\fscy56.76\frz-20.012\frx1.272\fry-1.017\org(826.53,1100.19)\pos(403.06,-124.62)}aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa preparations\N aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa, right?\N Could someone take a look at that?
Comment: 1,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an4\fnSFProText-Light-STR\c&H0000FF&\fscx52.2\fscy56.76\frz-20.012\frx1.272\fry-1.017\org(826.53,1100.19)\pos(403.06,230.38)}I had them show me the club’s summer vacation\N plans—only five days free. I’m having them fix that.\N Apparently, even some parents called about it.\N Man, if they’d actually *complained* to the school,\N the club would’ve been forced to reduce time…
Comment: 1,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an4\fnSFProText-Light-STR\c&H0000FF&\fscx52.2\fscy56.76\frz-20.012\frx1.272\fry-1.017\org(826.53,1100.19)\pos(403.06,603.38)}There were people still practicing at 9pm\N yesterday, I sent em home. looks like they'll keep\N trying to steal a march unless someone keeps\N watch.
Comment: 1,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an4\fnSFProText-Light-STR\c&H0000FF&\fscx52.2\fscy56.76\frz-20.012\frx1.272\fry-1.017\org(826.53,1100.19)\pos(403.06,135.38)}They keep practicing in secret even though I\N asked the advisor to lock the gym after the evening\N practice...\N Guess we alumni have to keep watch?
Comment: 1,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnSFProText-Light-STR\c&H0000FF&\fscx54.42\fscy57.1\frz-19.095\frx1.252\fry-1.001\org(1213.86,1016.19)\pos(635.46,584.7)}I'll help too when I can.\N I'll check if the gym lights are on when\N I'm going home after a late drive.
Comment: 1,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnSFProText-Light-STR\c&H0000FF&\fscx52.2\fscy56.76\frz-20.012\frx1.272\fry-1.017\org(826.53,1100.19)\pos(403.06,728.38)}And that's our Araragi!
Comment: 1,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnSFProText-Light-STR\c&H0000FF&\fscx52.2\fscy56.76\frz-20.012\frx1.272\fry-1.017\org(826.53,1100.19)\pos(403.06,943.38)}Take me on those late drives with you too!
Comment: 0,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.09,MarySigns,,0,0,0,,
