Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.58,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Higasa Seiu. Position, small forward.\NFavorite play, steal.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.76,0:00:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shounou Mitono. Position, point guard.\NFavorite play, double-team.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.94,0:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayoko Reika. Position, shooting guard.\NFavorite play, run-and-gun.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.84,0:00:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Umikawa Nikawa. Position, power forward.\NFavorite play, alley-oop.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.48,0:00:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Silvia Severe. Position, center.\NFavorite play, block.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.22,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohki Seiko. Position, reserve and sixth man.\NFavorite play, cheering.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.97,0:01:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru Suruga. Araragi{*}-senpai{*}'s sex slave. Favorite play,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.87,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,neglect!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.79,0:01:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,About the five members who are currently missing...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.30,0:01:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something in common among these five?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.93,0:01:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have anything in common.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.76,0:01:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think they've been in a game together, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.31,0:01:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So it's hard to group the five of them together as a team.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.73,0:01:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then what if it was just four?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.98,0:01:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A common point among four of them...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.36,0:01:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Their cellphones...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Possibly... Maybe... Conceivably...{i'd love to use some rhyme here like perhaps-mayhaps to echo the "~suruto" repeats}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.07,0:01:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not about finding a common point among the five.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.79,0:01:44.62,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not assuming that they're one team.{in this context this is how i'd interpret the nakama}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.20,0:01:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What if this was a language puzzle in school where you\N look at five items and choose the one that's different?{not specifically japanese -- rather the native language class in school}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.22,0:01:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something off. Something different.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.38,0:01:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not unlike a college freshman attending a pajama party of high school girls,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.19,0:02:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the odd one out.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.14,0:02:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, I see. That's what it means.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.85,0:02:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remembered the favor I asked of Kanbaru
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.27,0:02:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the conversation I had with Meniko.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.37,0:02:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's how our investigation intel got leaked.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.28,0:02:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's the case, the place where I need to be
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.16,0:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:22.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:22.01,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not over there. Over here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.57,0:03:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Been a while, high school girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.82,0:03:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're doing well, \Nwhich puts me in good spirits.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.91,0:03:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And you seem to be doing well, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I gave you a proper burial?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.05,0:03:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.05,0:04:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I died yet again.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.59,0:04:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I ingested your blood. No, your poison.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.27,0:04:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make it sound like it's my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.35,0:04:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You died on your own, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.89,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I merely buried you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just buried me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.69,0:04:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all things, you then used my name to do whatever you pleased.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.57,0:04:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to throw the investigation off,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.99,0:04:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but I do feel bad about using your name without asking.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.45,0:04:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when I buried you on that mountain, \NI didn't do it with any particular ill will.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.50,0:04:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So why did you bury me on that particular mountain, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.01,0:04:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to bury you,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.47,0:04:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might rest easier if you were buried close to the shrine.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.68,0:04:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I had the god who found my corpse step away for a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.69,0:04:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you have something to talk to me about, Suicide-master?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.19,0:05:07.20,Default,,1,1,0,,To think a bearer of my tough and cool blood would be stalking\N the streets at night for a reason as lame as revenge.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.87,0:05:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you wanted? Is that why you wanted to become a vampire?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.70,0:05:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you wanted me to eat you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.21,0:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I didn't tell the people chasing you about that part yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of covering for you,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.28,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but I told them I sucked your blood to maintain appearances in front of my old friend.{implying she wouldn't want to meet shinobu in her fatigued state?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.30,0:05:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.93,0:05:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was simply asking for directions,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.60,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but you suddenly started groveling and begged me to make you a vampire.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell them about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.60,0:05:47.69,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,And to think that {\i1}I'm{\i0} the one who turned into a mummy after that.{I definitely did _not_ expect to turn into a mummy from that myself.}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.69,0:05:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Life has its surprises, even if you live for a thousand years.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.58,0:05:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So I suppose I'm a rare breed, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.01,0:05:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,An idiot who requests to become a vampire by their own will, I mean.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.54,0:06:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really. I can think of another example from 600 years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.05,0:06:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I was reminded of that. Perhaps that's\N why I was getting a bit sentimental.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.59,0:06:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sentimental?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.76,0:06:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The former minion of the former Heart-under-blade
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.11,0:06:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,seems to be putting a lot of thought into these recent meals.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.28,0:06:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you ask me, he's missing the crux of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.79,0:06:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only seeing eater and eatee as assaulter and victim.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.23,0:06:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His assumptions exclude the case where the eaten {\i1}wish{\i0} to be eaten.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.42,0:06:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine any animal{the interjected TS makes sense in this sentence. it'd be something like}{I can't imagine any animal}{Other than myself}{that'd be willing to be eaten.}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,that'd be willing to be eaten.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.30,0:06:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.72,0:06:52.68,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{this appears to be orphaned from the novel's context, so if it seems like a non-sequitur, cut it or replace it with something random}{maybe include the sm line she's responding to? like}It's one thing to hope bad things happen to you,\N but to actually go and ask for it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.68,0:06:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, there was a creature like that 600 years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.59,0:07:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A human like that. A princess like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.27,0:07:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She tried to become a vampire with lofty ideals
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.98,0:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that a tough, cool person like myself could not understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.07,0:07:12.11,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,And unlike you, it was most productive.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.03,0:07:18.83,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Nowadays, she's forgotten all about her\N lofty ideals. They're nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.83,0:07:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess she managed to accomplish it all.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.54,0:07:26.17,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,That makes me feel relieved from the bottom of my heart.{this is such a classic monogatari translation problem lol. translate the phrase properly, lose the reference. i tried thinking of various phrases with "gut" or "stomach," but all my good lines were rewrites.}{maybe something like "i can almost taste the relief"? idk}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.17,0:07:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You used your immense power to greedily devour humans.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.76,0:07:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel accomplished now?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.85,0:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like I accomplished anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.31,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like I feel a void. \NRevenge is simply fruitless.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.28,0:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. In that aspect, it was a letdown.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.53,0:07:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My hopes were dashed.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.45,0:07:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought vampires were something better.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.71,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To begin with, isn't being weak against the sun just the worst?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.84,0:08:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for sure. We're not all that great.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.22,0:08:14.72,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Look at me. I'm trapped like a rat who's\N about to get a long-due extermination.{rewrite. the missing LN context makes it hard to write this line for me, so I'm writing something that tries to capture that whole context... but *please* change it if you have something more reasonable}{goose is cooked?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.72,0:08:17.10,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Don't make me more disappointed than I already am.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.51,0:08:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where I wanted you to serenade me with all the perks of being a vampire.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.06,0:08:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're feeling is not disappointment but despair.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.31,0:08:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But in that case, allow me to dangle a tasty morsel in front of you.{looking ahead to the "tasty deal" wordplay, which is important to preserve for obvious reasons}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.82,0:08:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing good about vampires, \Nbut I have a good deal all the same.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.20,0:08:38.20,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Something good? "Focus on the bright side" and such?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.70,0:08:41.08,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Vampires don't have a "bright side."
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.08,0:08:44.09,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,If anything, this is a business deal.{i'd love to make this rhyme somehow with the previous lines because of the 美談 / 商談  play}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hear it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.09,0:08:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This tasty deal or whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.34,0:08:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.68,0:08:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to return to being human,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.22,0:09:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,if you gulp down my blood, the blood of the one who sucked your blood,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.47,0:09:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you can still return to being human.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.52,0:09:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I mention anything about wanting to regain my humanity?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.28,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I did say this wasn't a good thing to be,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.74,0:09:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't say that it was a terrible thing to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.86,0:09:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you said it was "the worst."
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.87,0:09:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a figure of speech.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just nitpicking my words.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.95,0:09:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't recall saying that humans were the best, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.88,0:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or that high school girls were the best.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think that way,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.05,0:09:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,then not only should you drink my blood, \Nbut you should chow down and eat all of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.22,0:09:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Crunch down to the flesh and bones.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.76,0:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, the incomplete vampire that you are\N will become a master-slaying vampire
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.18,0:09:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and gain more power than you currently possess.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.23,0:09:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In either case, there are no drawbacks for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.98,0:09:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to return to being human, \Nyou can return to being human.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.98,0:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to become a more powerful,\N more fearsome vampire,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.82,0:10:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you can become a more powerful, \Nmore fearsome vampire.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what will it be?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.08,0:10:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in it for you, though? \NWhat do you get out of this deal?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.96,0:10:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This tasty morsel, this business deal...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.22,0:10:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The death-cheating, death-meeting, death-bringing vampire
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.51,0:10:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,is going to die for someone like me?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.23,0:10:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not. The basics of a business deal is to serve both ends.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.53,0:10:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you don't drink or eat me, \NI'm going to die anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.69,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to starve to death. \NI'll die from anorexia.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.53,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just {\i1}lame{\i0}, don'tcha think?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.99,0:10:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I want you to kill me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.41,0:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to kill me, but do it {\i1}right{\i0} this time. \NI want you to kill me properly.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.71,0:10:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're suicidal?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.50,0:11:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighty or ninety percent of vampires die from suicide, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.93,0:11:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. They all commit suicide.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.93,0:11:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I want you to kill me before I feel like committing suicide.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.31,0:11:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want me to aid and abet your suicide... \NNo, you're wishing for euthanasia?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.23,0:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Call it a death with dignity.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.11,0:11:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the death fit for a proud one such as myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.99,0:11:24.41,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,A noble, merciless death.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.76,0:11:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it me? Why did you choose me?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who needs to choose.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.13,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I phrased it like two choices, but you don't have to suck {\i1}or{\i0} eat if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.43,0:11:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in my weakened state, there's only a limited number of beings who can kill me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.72,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in no particular hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.06,0:11:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not hurrying to my death.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.94,0:11:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I just no longer have regrets.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.27,0:11:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because an old friend
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.65,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,is thoughtlessly and lightheartedly having fun, \Nand I witnessed it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.11,0:12:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing I regret anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.70,0:12:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll kill you. \NAnd then we'll call it even.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I, someone who has killed herself...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.92,0:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I, myself, will kill you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.29,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please die filled with pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please die a noble, merciless death.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.92,0:12:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much. It was worth pleading with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.97,0:12:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.30,0:12:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.85,0:12:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know the name of the vampire who will be killing my great self.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.27,0:12:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.31,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My name, the name of the one who will kill you, is...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Harimaze Kie.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.87,0:12:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Harimaze Kie.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.25,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not Kiseki Sowa.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.71,0:12:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's Harimaze{*}-chan{*}, who was believed to be the first victim.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a body swap.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.75,0:12:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The mummified humans were bone dry,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.75,0:13:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and their features and appearances were consistent.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.19,0:13:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You could even say all the mummies were unidentifiable.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.93,0:13:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So how did we identify that mummy as Harimaze{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was because of her belongings.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.14,0:13:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Conversely, if you put your uniform on the mummy,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.57,0:13:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}gave it your bag, and had it hold onto your phone,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.99,0:13:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}wouldn't you be able to make people believe that the mummy was you?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.40,0:13:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.24,0:13:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,when considering which of the mummies got swapped,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.07,0:13:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,all the mummies had the same probability of being the one.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.37,0:13:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The key to all this turned out to be the first{i hate how the anime REFUSES to modify nisio's lines in any way even where it would make things so much more clear, like this does. i mean, i get that the background visuals clarify it, but...} code that Meniko deciphered for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.25,0:13:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a diversionary tactic that required knowledge of Gaen{*}-san{*} and the investigators.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.93,0:13:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means, at that point, the internal goings-on of the investigation had already been leaked.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.30,0:13:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How did the serial vampire ascertain Gaen{*}-san{*} and her group's existence?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.47,0:13:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I came upon that method after my conversation with Meniko, which gave me a hint.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.02,0:14:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cell phones are like a part of our brains, she'd said.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.65,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The perpetrator put the phone on the mummy\N they made, along with the uniform and school bag.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.74,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You could say it was like she installed the mummy with her eyes, ears, and brain.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like a surveillance camera and a wire tap.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.62,0:14:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are plenty of apps like that—that continue to run in the background even when the phone is locked.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.46,0:14:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And this is where it gets important.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.17,0:14:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is impossible unless the perp had already set up the app at the point of finding the first mummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.05,0:14:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She had to have set it up in the cellphone planted among the belongings of the suspected Harimaze Kie mummy.{liberal, but aniplex's attempt to retain the original structure was hilarious}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.02,0:14:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she hadn't, she couldn't have left a code with Kuchimoto Kyoumi's mummy, as she was the second one attacked.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.57,0:14:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And furthermore, cellphones must be recharged periodically or the battery will run out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.45,0:14:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means that the fact that we chose the Kanbaru residence to revive Suicide-master,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.33,0:15:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the fact that we accordingly had Kanbaru make herself scarce, are things the perp is unaware of.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.88,0:15:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She wouldn't target the alumni gathering at Higasa{*}-chan{*}'s house.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.09,0:15:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She would quite naturally target the Kanbaru estate.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.31,0:15:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A pervert?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.56,0:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You must be Araragi{*}-senpai{*}.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.86,0:15:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Araragi{*}-senpai{*}.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.70,0:15:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time we're chatting like this, \Nbut I've heard all kinds of rumors about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.21,0:15:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're out saving people like you always do?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.08,0:15:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, there's not a single human here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.55,0:15:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Harimaze{*}-chan{*}...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.54,0:15:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like how you understand my circumstances, \NI understand yours just a little bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But even then, this is going too far.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.69,0:16:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I went too far. I just quit too far.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.02,0:16:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because I couldn't quit the team
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.78,0:16:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean that I had to quit living entirely.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.03,0:16:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still make it in time.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.79,0:16:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's revert all the people you assaulted, \Nand revert yourself as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.46,0:16:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer that you leave me alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And who knows about the others?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.76,0:16:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they want to become human again?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.64,0:16:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe things are easier for them in their current state.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.15,0:16:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe what I did wasn't assaulting, but saving?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.65,0:16:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.40,0:16:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.40,0:16:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're completely dried up. \NYou can't even tell if they're alive or dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.95,0:17:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't tell if you're alive or dead, \Ndoesn't that mean you're just a {\i1}normal high schooler{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.37,0:17:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How you're completely parched on the inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.04,0:17:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget those feelings once you became a college student?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.88,0:17:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think we're being bubbly and enjoying adolescence?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.84,0:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we look like high school girls with no worries whatsoever, Araragi{*}-senpai{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.31,0:17:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They say green is the color of immaturity,\N but adolescence has a much deeper shade.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.60,0:17:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dark blue, bordering on black.{rip viewers with ears and english proficiency}{rip}{actually there's too much damn blue in this arc to change this}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.02,0:17:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As a self in winter who has long since forgotten adolescence,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.69,0:17:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,this debate makes me feel awkward.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.03,0:17:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't that kind of back-and-forth what youth is all about? Hilarious.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.70,0:17:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't make up your mind\N fast enough. This is what you get.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.38,0:17:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's eat or be eaten.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.51,0:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat, or do you want to be eaten?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.67,0:17:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.84,0:17:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat your master, \Nor do you want to eat the protagonist?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.64,0:17:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.26,0:18:02.85,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Whether shallow or deep{same koi as with the colors earlier, lucky shallow works}, I'm sick of adolescence already.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.23,0:18:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have chosen the red darkness.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.36,0:18:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in the wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.11,0:18:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me make even more mistakes.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.70,0:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Harimaze Kie!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.82,0:18:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Born on April 14th, age 16. \NHeight, 170 cm. Position, reserve.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.08,0:18:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My favorite play is a fake!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.34,0:18:30.25,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,This time for sure, I will eat the protagonist!{if this is some metaphorical meaning about her becoming/usurping the main character, we should try to convey that}{the shuyaku (protag) word came from sm in that earlier line. in the novel araragi narrator comments how it makes no sense, so i assume this is supposed to be a 4th wall joke?}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.89,0:18:49.06,Default,kag,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Araragi{*}-kun{*}.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.81,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch for stalling for time.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.31,0:18:55.07,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Those pigtails look good on ye, yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.07,0:18:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going too far, Kagenui{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.33,0:19:01.83,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Did I nae teach ye before, Araragi{*}-kun{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.83,0:19:06.33,Default,kag,0,0,0,,There is nae such thing as going too far against an immortal oddity.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.62,0:19:09.34,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Right, Suicide-master?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.71,0:19:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Even in the eyes of a monster like me, \Nyou go way too far, Kagenui.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.34,0:19:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing isn't a vampire that you need to personally deal with. It's a fledgling.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.85,0:19:25.35,Default,kag,0,0,0,,She's nae a vampire worth dealing with? A fledgling?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.35,0:19:29.10,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Surely that describes yer current self more than her.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.48,0:19:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A little girl, just like you were back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.36,0:19:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this isn't going to work out.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.59,0:19:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'm not exactly a worthy target in your eyes.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.24,0:19:42.86,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Seems so.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.86,0:19:47.25,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,I literally flew down here from the North Pole and got greeted with whatever ye've turned into.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.25,0:19:50.88,Default,kag,0,0,0,,It looks like I have tae let ye off the hook for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.88,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How lucky.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.00,0:19:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I can't tell who was luckier between you and me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.14,0:20:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I have lived yet again.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.64,0:20:03.39,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.68,0:20:05.39,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi{*}-kun{*}.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.01,0:20:08.00,Default,kag,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.82,0:20:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what happened to the high school girl after that?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.41,0:20:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What was her name... Harimaya{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.66,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world is Harimaya{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.24,0:20:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're talking about Harimaze{*}-chan{*},
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.83,0:20:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally thought that Kagenui{*}-san{*} was going to slaughter her.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.67,0:20:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was told she had to stay her hand so that the\N four girls in the hospital could be reverted to normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.68,0:20:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it was more adult circumstances\N than juvenile law that was applied here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.72,0:20:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If we didn't revert that girl to a human, \Nthe other four would stay mummies forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.23,0:20:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.23,0:20:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you become a vampire, don't you have to kill your "parent" in order to regain your humanity?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.98,0:21:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,When it was me dealing with this stuff during spring break,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.61,0:21:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that definitely was the case.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.53,0:21:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But steady progress has been made on that end, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the naked girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.20,0:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Suicide-master ultimately got exiled. \NThey settled for deportation.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Their farewell was rather simple.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.42,0:21:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess vampiric feelings, or rather vampiric time, \Naren't something I understand well.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.35,0:21:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's likely not the final farewell of this lifetime,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm sure we'll see her again.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why are you quiet? Do you know something?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.53,0:21:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think of it, I felt like Shinobu knew something but was keeping it a secret from me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.61,0:21:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what she'd been hiding was apparent in a comment she made after the fact.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.95,0:22:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a belated reply to my question of, \N"What are humans to you?"
Dialogue: 10,0:22:01.67,0:22:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.84,0:22:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomin.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.09,0:22:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, does that mean you've fulfilled\N your verbal agreement with Gaen{*}-san{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.60,0:22:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where it all started, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.10,0:22:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's taken effect, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.40,0:22:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lies, deception, fakes...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.06,0:22:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If a human's human side is going to get involved like this,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.24,0:22:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the establishment of a Rumor Division is imperative after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.41,0:22:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that time has come.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.20,0:22:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can say the same for Harimaze{*}-chan{*}, \Nbut the fact that it's allowed is ultimately
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.54,0:22:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm still very much a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.42,0:22:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness. The time for my next lecture is approaching.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.81,0:22:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, see you again in the near future.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.22,0:22:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have anything I want from you, I'll contact you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.56,0:23:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the template for when you're not going to contact me?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.60,0:23:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.57,0:23:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got something cute there.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.32,0:23:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So I suppose you're a member of the girls' basketball team now?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:09.74,0:23:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm already past the point of no return.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.12,0:23:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,With Kanbaru and Higasa{*}-chan{*}'s assistance,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.29,0:23:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly help out with the plan to do something about the present situation.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.35,0:23:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that exactly where you're still a child, Araragi{*}-kun{*}?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.68,0:23:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagenui{*}-san{*}, don't you ever hesitate?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:39.23,0:23:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What she had done was an unforgivable crime, \Nwhether we're talking about human law or demon law.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.74,0:23:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But still, I couldn't help but keep Harimaze Kie's circumstances in mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:50.37,0:23:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I kept them in mind, and I hesitated.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.87,0:23:56.87,Default,kag,0,0,0,,I'm an adult. I don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.04,0:24:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That unique reply, which I'm pretty sure isn't representative of the majority opinion,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.00,0:24:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was serene and lacked all hesitation.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.63,0:24:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.09,0:24:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's what it means to be an adult, \NI'm nothing more than a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.30,0:24:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am a child younger than a young girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.85,0:24:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just like the vampires who were granted a stay of execution...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.89,0:24:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if I become immortal, even if I go to Hell,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.69,0:24:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}even if I graduate from high school, \Nand even if I become a college student,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.65,0:24:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Araragi Koyomi is, to this day, \Nin the middle of a moratorium.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.99,0:24:35.03,MarySigns,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:35.43,0:24:37.09,EDeng,,0,0,0,,UNHAPPY?\NA troubled human child
Dialogue: 1,0:24:37.09,0:24:38.80,EDeng,,0,0,0,,UNLUCKY?\NFor the inhumane
Dialogue: 1,0:24:38.80,0:24:40.40,EDeng,,0,0,0,,BE HAPPY!\NAim timelessly
Dialogue: 1,0:24:40.40,0:24:42.10,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Because you're alive
Dialogue: 1,0:24:42.10,0:24:43.72,EDeng,,0,0,0,,The past you tried to forget
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.72,0:24:45.43,EDeng,,0,0,0,,And that boring future too
Dialogue: 1,0:24:45.43,0:24:46.23,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Counseling
Dialogue: 1,0:24:46.23,0:24:47.14,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Oh man
Dialogue: 1,0:24:47.14,0:24:48.81,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Anytime anywhere, peace, peace
Dialogue: 1,0:24:48.81,0:24:49.92,EDeng,,0,0,0,,UNHAPPY?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:50.36,0:24:51.54,EDeng,,0,0,0,,UNLUCKY?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.03,0:24:53.22,EDeng,,0,0,0,,BE HAPPY!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:53.69,0:24:54.93,EDeng,,0,0,0,,UNDEAD
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.64,0:25:02.77,EDeng,,0,0,0,,C-C-Cut-in!
Dialogue: 1,0:25:02.77,0:25:03.85,EDeng,,0,0,0,,For some reason
Dialogue: 1,0:25:03.85,0:25:05.91,EDeng,,0,0,0,,The future feels
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.91,0:25:09.04,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Just so bleak and devoid of hope
Dialogue: 1,0:25:09.04,0:25:10.47,EDeng,,0,0,0,,I've been around for quite a while
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.47,0:25:12.09,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Fed up with deja vu a la carte{deja vu and cookie cutter repeat}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:12.09,0:25:15.28,EDeng,,0,0,0,,There's not a hint of anything nice incoming
Dialogue: 1,0:25:15.28,0:25:16.09,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Such a shame
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.09,0:25:17.27,EDeng,,0,0,0,,The years take their toll
Dialogue: 1,0:25:17.27,0:25:19.48,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Left with myths without substance and dull progress
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.48,0:25:20.71,EDeng,,0,0,0,,I just want some excitement
Dialogue: 1,0:25:20.71,0:25:21.38,EDeng,,0,0,0,,I'm bored
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.38,0:25:22.02,EDeng,,0,0,0,,I'm used to it all
Dialogue: 1,0:25:22.02,0:25:22.59,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Just kidding
Dialogue: 1,0:25:22.59,0:25:24.28,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Guidelines getting more detailed
Dialogue: 1,0:25:24.28,0:25:25.77,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Compliance getting more complicated
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.77,0:25:27.68,EDeng,,0,0,0,,I feel the lid closing over me
Dialogue: 1,0:25:27.68,0:25:29.27,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Drain me dry
Dialogue: 1,0:25:29.27,0:25:31.76,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Lock stock and barrel
Dialogue: 1,0:25:31.76,0:25:34.26,EDeng,,0,0,0,,All taste the same
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.26,0:25:34.78,EDeng,,0,0,0,,UNDEAD
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.78,0:25:36.17,EDeng,,0,0,0,,I'm not yet dead
Dialogue: 1,0:25:36.17,0:25:38.09,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Watching you repeating you
Dialogue: 1,0:25:38.09,0:25:42.14,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Living means changing
Dialogue: 1,0:25:42.14,0:25:45.44,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Don't give up and settle for misfortune
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.44,0:25:49.28,EDeng,,0,0,0,,It's not fair to give up striving for happiness
Dialogue: 1,0:25:49.28,0:25:52.21,EDeng,,0,0,0,,This world is a weird weird fantasy
Dialogue: 1,0:25:52.21,0:25:55.33,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Will a demon appear next or will a snake?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:55.33,0:25:58.84,EDeng,,0,0,0,,Encountering encounters starts the story
Dialogue: 1,0:25:58.84,0:26:00.77,EDeng,,0,0,0,,So is it human or a monster
Dialogue: 1,0:26:00.77,0:26:02.67,EDeng,,0,0,0,,But I digress, peace peace
